        rdfs:label "2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py L995–L1089" ;
        dcterms:description "Panels I-L rendering of the follicle-niche coupling" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/469bf3c/2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py#L995-L1089> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Haupaix et al. (2018), Inaba et al. (2019) & Lin et al. (2013) somite-prepatterned Agouti signaling, melanocyte gap-junction reaction-diffusion and feather-follicle ring-niche chevrons in galliform plumage stripes — Morphological realism / specimen match: 76/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Panels E-G keep the SHA-256-locked Coturnix japonica photograph with the DoG segmentation (4 yellow / 4 black stripes, period 35 px, yellow fraction 0.442, Ashman D 2.30) and the dorsoventral profile overlay; Panels I-L add the follicle lattice (yellow rows visibly 4 of 9 per period), a 3D cylinder with the ring niche, opened follicles whose yellow band lengthens from edge row to centre row to Fawn and carries the chevron, and the RB / WT / Fa row-count bars. Deductions: the specimen is an adult-plumage Wikimedia photograph, not a juvenile flat-skin preparation like Haupaix Fig. 1A, and the ROI stripes are not established to be the cb/ly/lb sequence the paper describes (-8); no figure of the paper is vendored for a side-by-side (-6); the chevron panels are compared only with their own analytic law, not with a feather photograph or Lin fig. S9 (-6); Panel A remains small with its title overlapping the colour bar (-2); the GIF shows only the body-wide field (-2)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/avian_plumage_somite_stripes/avian_plumage_somite_stripes_reference.json L31–L40: Specimen is an adult Coturnix japonica photograph (Wikimedia CC BY-SA 2.0), not a juvenile flat skin <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/469bf3c/datasets/avian_plumage_somite_stripes/avian_plumage_somite_stripes_reference.json#L31-L40>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-specimen-match-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-specimen-match-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-specimen-match-3> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.76"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

